type: software
title: "Job Search Agent System: an agentic decision-support system with human review"
abstract: >-
  Public documentation of a decision-support system for a job search, operated daily with an AI agent
  (Claude Code): architecture, quality controls, decision records, lessons from real failures and
  reference implementations, documented with invented data. A human approves every document and makes
  every submission.
